<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to auction 3yr bonds of HUF17bln on Dec 19.</title>
<headline>Hungary to auction 3yr bonds of HUF17bln on Dec 19.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will auction 17 billion forints worth of the three-year government bonds of 1999/D series on December 19, the Government Debt Managament Agency (AKK) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Date of issue	     31 October 1996</p>
<p>    Date of maturity	  24 October 1999</p>
<p>    Bonds on offer	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Minimum net price	 100.42 pct</p>
<p>Average price at last</p>
<p>	 auction (Nov 21)     101.43 pct @</p>
<p>NOTE - The 1999/D bonds have a fixed interest of 21 percent annually, to be paid twice a year, on April 24 and October 24.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
